Tolna_Tome-Monger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\">Tolna Tome-Monger</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Mutability is the essence of life itself; all is ever-changing, growing and shrinking, building and breaking down. The devotee to the School of <a href=\"/wiki/Transmutation\" title=\"Transmutation\">Transmutation</a> learns to wield the raw material of life into desired forms.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nKey terms: Change, exchange, alchemy\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nKey concepts: Altering, Prestidigitation, Purification, Mending\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715050359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1525/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26074/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6598/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931496/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.667      1 -total\n 97.94%   37.870      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 50.23%   19.424      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.60%   17.245     15 Template:Trim\n 23.91%    9.246      2 Template:Uid\n 16.13%    6.238      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.32%    5.539      2 Template:Template_style\n 14.11%    5.456      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.80%    4.177      1 Template:Books\n  9.94%    3.842      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache